{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"534707b8e8f131a755f7494cdb8c6afb6e58e0121458d8805cf238ab8767fc0a","ja":"……ふふっ、ふふふ♪","zh":"……呵呵，呵呵呵♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f2d2b101a1780acb1a2ba75c91eb86e83c4c06874d9a2f99a9135b4c6749baff","ja":"あら？　真、なんだかとっても幸せそうですわね。\nそちらのマンガのおかげかしら？","zh":"哎呀？真，你看起来特别幸福呢。\n是因为那边的漫画吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"adba04a97e34d7e64feea71a824b4f5efdfaa8b37dcdf317419cb76447dc5daa","ja":"はい！　『寒い時には君の手を』、通称『寒君』\nっていう、知る人ぞ知る少女マンガなんです！","zh":"是的！这是一本名为《寒冷时分牵起你的手》、俗称《寒君》的少女漫画，只有熟悉的人才知道！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"283fb41ca897cfac47c9f0d57e1b14e29d1beabaab8e956bae2cefac813dbdcb","ja":"最新巻が出たんですけど、\nすっごくキュンキュンしちゃって……。","zh":"最新一卷出了，\n让我心动不已……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"120e702465fe1b1401cc4eb4109217428f74766617639dcde63fe5894c9e4830","ja":"主人公の女の子が\nとうとう自分の恋心を自覚するんです！","zh":"女主角终于意识到了自己的心意！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3939d061713eaa8347263bb46e7f98c49d569b1fe96b6702451529b5ad3f6ab7","ja":"まあ……♪　何かが始まる予感がして、\nドキドキしちゃいますわね……！","zh":"总觉得……♪ 好像有什么要开始了，心里都怦怦跳起来了呢……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2b48d2c407d229f43649fd478ec5f188a60fb2b8192c097c9da1c6fefefebdac","ja":"はい、本当にドキドキで。夜景を見ながら\nイケメンの葵くんが優しく手を握ってくれて急接近！？","zh":"是的，真的让人心跳加速。看着夜景时，帅气的葵君温柔地握住了手，两人的距离骤然拉近！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ef1c30aa0cfd3525f94cb1b4d94d856a46e1237330b48fdc187db74dbfbc108a","ja":"……ってところで葵くんのことが好きなクラスメイトが\nやってきちゃって……惜しかったなぁ～。","zh":"……正说到这里，喜欢葵同学的同班同学就来了……真是可惜啊～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7d84be049c6d779241b6799d61790db39362f5e1535542bcb5a12476e7f034ef","ja":"ふふ。すっかり夢中ですのね。\nなんだかわたくしも、気になってきましたわ。","zh":"呵呵。您已经完全沉浸其中了呢。\n不知不觉，连我也开始感兴趣了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b3501824a31bbb64fbe04e0e95a8122317d48c3879e96a3b1b830a25448bc153","ja":"そうですか！？　もしよければ読んで\nみてください！　1巻から持ってきますから！","zh":"这样啊！？如果不介意的话，请读\n读看！我会从第1卷拿过来的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"867fe9412cab17c6e116d33ed088fc434fd19460f0fad121d39d3418d5ab6555","ja":"ええ。ぜひ、お願いしますわ。","zh":"好的。那就拜托您了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f1738cabb83f742b573a321dcbac62bdb75f9800989a54380334134e2dc5f6ee","ja":"はいっ。背景も見覚えがあって、きっと驚きますよ！\n舞台が東京なんです。","zh":"是的！连背景也似曾相识，您一定会大吃一惊的！\n舞台是在东京。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bd0299b1391fd0637f9a0b00ecf40e4004b10738570d17975a588e45bdb954bd","ja":"最新刊で出てきた夜景が見えるビルも近くにある\nらしくて、今度行ってみようかな～って思ってました。","zh":"听说附近还有一栋能看到夜景的楼，就在最新一卷里出现过，我想着下次要不要去看看～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"cf922455f3b159d2066accd4d9ed4ce1277970d39c6b9eac88109166519c313e","ja":"あら、素敵ですわね♪　もしよろしければ、\nわたくしもご一緒させていただけませんこと？","zh":"哎呀，真不错呢♪如果您不介意的话，能让我也一起去吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_972.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"706b06e13878e0857e425da2d939bba11174d66ae4a39882c095ef13c8714336","ja":"わあっ、もちろんです！　あ、他にも\n行きたい人いるかも！　ボク、声かけてみますね♪","zh":"哇，当然可以！啊，说不定还有其他人也想去！我去问问看♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
